                <pb facs="1261" n="1103" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1103"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 9.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Thompson to American Consul
                    Canada</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-10-27"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 27,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Has schooner <hi rendition="#italic">Aloha</hi> been released? If so, on what
                    date?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">D. E. Thompson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
